<title>USA: Union Carbide sells plastics recycling.</title>
<headline>Union Carbide sells plastics recycling.</headline>
<dateline>DANBURY, Conn. 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Union Carbide Corp said it has sold its plastics recycling operations to privately held Ecoplast Corp for undisclosed terms.</p>
<p>Ecoplast said that the acquisition will allow it to expand its recycling business in Los Angeles and Chino, Calif., and to explore further opportunities for growth.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
